    <name>Madrid to Barcelona — road driving track</name>
    <desc>Driving route from Plaza de Cibeles, Madrid, to Plaça de Catalunya, Barcelona. Distance: 616.4 km. Full-resolution planned road geometry from the OSRM driving profile, using OpenStreetMap data. May include motorways and toll roads. Elevations are terrain-model estimates in metres above sea level, bilinearly sampled from Terrarium terrain tiles at zoom 13 through oms.rbel.co. Terrain elevations can differ from the road surface at tunnels and bridges.</desc>
